*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0047
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-06-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 121
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0047.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CLNT-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    05 ACCT-BALANCE       PIC 9(9)V99.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCT-TYP           PIC X.
    *> BASE INTEREST RATE
    05 BASE-INT-RATE      PIC 9V9999.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 EFFECTIVE-RATE     PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM APPLY-BONUS
    PERFORM 2600-FIXED-DEP
    DISPLAY "EFFECTIVE-RATE=" EFFECTIVE-RATE
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-BONUS.
    *> SENIOR SAVER BONUS - LIMIT 32 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CLNT-AGE >= 65
       AND ACCT-BALANCE >= 5000
        COMPUTE EFFECTIVE-RATE = BASE-INT-RATE + 0.0050
    ELSE
        MOVE BASE-INT-RATE TO EFFECTIVE-RATE
    END-IF.
2600-FIXED-DEP.
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'F'
        COMPUTE EFFECTIVE-RATE ROUNDED = EFFECTIVE-RATE + 0.0015
    END-IF.
